    "description": "Handcrafted Artisan Keepsake Box\nNatural Wood, Slate Stone, and Sliced Agate Geode\nOrganic Modern Decorative Storage\nThis striking artisan keepsake box combines natural materials with functional design, featuring a solid wood base paired with a fitted black slate lid. The cover is adorned with a polished natural agate geode slice mounted with a central brass finial, creating an earthy yet sophisticated organic modern accent piece.\nHandcrafted solid wood base with distinctive natural grain patterns and angled profile\nHeavy black slate stone lid with recessed underside for secure placement\nPolished natural agate geode slice accent featuring translucent banding and crystal center\nMeasures approximately 7\" length x 5.25\" width x 4\" height\nCondition:\nVery good vintage condition with sturdy structural integrity. Wood exterior exhibits warm patina and light surface wear consistent with age, with some cosmetic discoloration on the unfinished interior bottom board. Slate lid sits flush with minor natural edge roughness. Agate specimen is firmly mounted with no chips or cracks.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
